    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You are a Master of Luka Sene techniques and an expert in using sense-related <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talents\" title=\"Talents\">Talents</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a>. Once per encounter, you gain a temporary <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> that you must spend when activating a Talent from either the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sense_Talent_Tree\" title=\"Sense Talent Tree\">Sense Talent Tree</a> or Luka Sene Talent Tree, when using the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Farseeing\" title=\"Farseeing\">Farseeing</a></i> Force Power, or on a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check made to use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Search_Your_Feelings\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Search Your Feelings\">Search Your Feelings</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sense_Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sense Force\">Sense Force</a> applications of the skill.<br><br>The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> is lost if not used before the end of the encounter.",
